        "form_id": "03000818|VelynTheNetch.esp",
        "type": "DIAL FULL",
        "index": null,
        "editor_id": "VTN_RevusRemindTopic"
    },
    {
        "original": "That netch of yours still trailing after you? Good. Keep her close and she'll lighten your load without complaint - just mind you don't pack her satchel too full. Even a good-natured netch has her limits.",
        "string": "Votre netch vous suit toujours ? Bien. Gardez-la près de vous et elle allégera votre fardeau sans se plaindre, veillez seulement à ne pas trop remplir sa besace. Même un netch de bonne composition a ses limites.",
        "status": "TranslationComplete",
        "form_id": "0300080B|VelynTheNetch.esp",
        "type": "INFO NAM1",
        "index": 1,
        "editor_id": "VTN_RevusRemindInfo"
    },
